{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "%md\n# Kafka to Delta Lake Streaming Upsert (Hive Metastore \u0026 MinIO)\n**DAG Association:** `daily_kafka_to_delta_spark_job`\n\nThis pipeline mirrors an **AWS Glue + Athena** Lakehouse architecture:\n1. **Kafka Stream:** Consumes Protobuf events from `global_financial_transactions`.\n2. **Hive Metastore Registration:** Automatically registers the table in Hive (`lakehouse.financial_transactions`).\n3. **Delta Lake Upsert:** Micro-batch `MERGE INTO` (upsert) by `transaction_id` using `DeltaTable.forName`.\n4. **Trino / Athena Querying:** Queryable from Trino via `SELECT * FROM minio_delta.lakehouse.financial_transactions`.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-11 13:33:38.447",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "enabled": true,
        "results": {},
        "editorHide": true,
        "tableHide": false
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "results": {
        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"markdown-body\"\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eKafka to Delta Lake Streaming Upsert (Hive Metastore \u0026amp; MinIO)\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDAG Association:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ccode\u003edaily_kafka_to_delta_spark_job\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pipeline mirrors an \u003cstrong\u003eAWS Glue + Athena\u003c/strong\u003e Lakehouse architecture:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKafka Stream:\u003c/strong\u003e Consumes Protobuf events from \u003ccode\u003eglobal_financial_transactions\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHive Metastore Registration:\u003c/strong\u003e Automatically registers the table in Hive (\u003ccode\u003elakehouse.financial_transactions\u003c/code\u003e).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDelta Lake Upsert:\u003c/strong\u003e Micro-batch \u003ccode\u003eMERGE INTO\u003c/code\u003e (upsert) by \u003ccode\u003etransaction_id\u003c/code\u003e using \u003ccode\u003eDeltaTable.forName\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrino / Athena Querying:\u003c/strong\u003e Queryable from Trino via \u003ccode\u003eSELECT * FROM minio_delta.lakehouse.financial_transactions\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e"
          }
        ]
      },
